What changed
- components/api-keys-tab.tsx (new): inline create form (name · expiry · scopes), raw key shown ONCE in a copy box, list with prefix/scopes/last-used/expiry/status, soft revoke via <InlineConfirm> (UX-1 · no dialogs)
- lib/api.ts: api.apiKeys.{list,create,revoke} + ApiKeyItem/ApiKeyScope types
- pages/settings.tsx: 5 surgical edits — "api-keys" tab id, tab label (مفاتيح API / API keys), render block gated to OWNER/ADMIN for management

Why
- Companion of API feat/api-keys (PR): agents/integrations get scoped, org-bound keys instead of passwords. Makes the pricing-page "Full API access" claim real (phase 1).

Not changed
- No other settings tabs, header/sidebar/auth, design tokens. Pre-merge gate: 0 dialog imports · 0 new alert/confirm/prompt · 0 <Dialog|Sheet>.

